<title>USA: Calvin Klein Cosmetics names CFO.</title>
<headline>Calvin Klein Cosmetics names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever Plc said on Tuesday its unit Calvin Klein Cosmetics Co named Jean Mortier vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Mortier has been with Unilever since 1984, the company said. Most recently, he was the commercial director at Elida Faberge based in Paris.</p>
